sequenceDiagram
  participant page as Stack page
  participant kia as kia
  participant svc as kia-stack service
  participant docker as stack.sh and Docker
  page->>kia: Check or Apply, with the password (HTTPS)
  kia->>kia: checks the parts and claim code
  kia->>svc: state/stack-request (id, action, parts)
  Note over svc: looks every 3 seconds
  svc->>svc: renames it into stack-service/, checks it again
  svc->>kia: result: running
  svc->>docker: scripts/stack.sh check or apply
  docker-->>svc: what the script printed
  svc->>kia: containers.tsv, then result: finished
  page->>kia: asks every few seconds
  kia-->>page: the answer for this id
